1. Upon the shimmering Sea of Glass, reflections of all realms gathered.
2. “All actions bear consequence; all silence bears witness,” the West Wind intoned.
3. The Watchers saw themselves mirrored, exile and redemption entwined.
4. Harmony began to flow through fractured histories.

---

